        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 469.8969,
        "r": 288.15999999999985,
        "b": 452.28900084033614
      },
      "content": "The thermistor is located under the tub and is attached to the back side of the sump with two screws. See Figure 1."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0063",
      "reading_order": 685,
      "section": "Thermistor",
      "bbox": {
