    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0616",
      "reading_order": 693,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 303.0,
        "t": 706.584,
        "r": 376.53600000000006,
        "b": 697.4545210084034
      },
      "content": "Test Procedure",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0617",
      "reading_order": 694,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 303.0,
        "t": 679.32,
        "r": 550.6600000000002,
        "b": 651.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "This test will check the wiring to the Thermistor, the control board, and the thermistor itself. The following items are part of the Thermistor circuit."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0618",
      "reading_order": 695,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 303.0,
        "t": 647.54,
        "r": 398.8200000000001,
        "b": 638.2303225806452
      },
      "content": "  Harness/Connection"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0619",
      "reading_order": 696,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 303.0,
        "t": 634.54,
        "r": 360.68000000000006,
        "b": 625.2303225806452
      },
      "content": "  Thermistor"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0620",
      "reading_order": 697,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 303.0,
        "t": 621.54,
        "r": 372.37,
        "b": 612.2303225806452
      },
      "content": "  Control Board"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0621",
      "reading_order": 698,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 594.32,
        "r": 553.0,
        "b": 576.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Check the operation of the Thermistor in Service Mode. (See 'note' on step #2 on Service Mode Chart, page 2-3.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0622",
      "reading_order": 699,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 571.32,
        "r": 485.5500000000002,
        "b": 563.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Unplug dishwasher or disconnect power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0623",
      "reading_order": 700,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 558.32,
        "r": 539.4100000000002,
        "b": 540.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Remove access panel. Remove control board cover to access control board."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0624",
      "reading_order": 701,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 535.32,
        "r": 555.3900000000002,
        "b": 507.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Lay the dishwasher on its back. Use a small flat-blade screwdriver to unclip snaps around the drip-pan. Remove drip-pan/float switch to access under tub components."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0625",
      "reading_order": 702,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 502.32,
        "r": 488.45959999999997,
        "b": 494.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Disconnect CN4 from the Control Board."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0626",
      "reading_order": 703,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 489.32,
        "r": 554.6900000000002,
        "b": 451.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Using an ohmmeter, measure resistance between CN42 (GND) and CN4-7 (RE). The following table provides approximate room and hot water temperatures and their associated resistance values."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0015",
      "reading_order": 704,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.35382080078125,
        "t": 449.24609375,
        "r": 559.2530517578125,
        "b": 402.0006103515625
      },
      "markdown": "| TEMP °F (°C)   | RES RANGE k ohms   |\n|----------------|--------------------|\n| 77° F (25° C)  | 10k ohms           |\n| 140° F (60° C) | 3k ohms            |"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0627",
      "reading_order": 705,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 321.0,
        "t": 385.82,
        "r": 548.1300000000003,
        "b": 358.2121008403361
      },
      "content": "NOTE: All thermistor resistance measurements must be made while dishwasher is unplugged or disconnected from power and connector CN4 removed from control."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0628",
      "reading_order": 706,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 317.0,
        "t": 354.04,
        "r": 544.1800000000003,
        "b": 335.2121008403361
      },
      "content": "¾ ¾ If the thermistor resistance does not agree with the table, replace the Thermistor."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0629",
      "reading_order": 707,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 317.0,
        "t": 331.04,
        "r": 551.3700000000001,
        "b": 302.2121008403361
      },
      "content": "¾ ¾ If an open circuit is detected, check connections and harness continuity between control and thermistor. If good, replace the thermistor."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0630",
      "reading_order": 708,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 317.0,
        "t": 298.04,
        "r": 542.1800000000002,
        "b": 279.2121008403361
      },
      "content": "¾ ¾ If the thermistor resistance is OK , the thermistor is good. Replace the control board and retest."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0631",
      "reading_order": 709,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 273.81999999999994,
        "r": 487.92000000000013,
        "b": 266.2121008403361
      },
      "content": "Unplug dishwasher or disconnect power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0632",
      "reading_order": 710,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 260.81999999999994,
        "r": 455.07000000000033,
        "b": 253.21210084033612
      },
      "content": "Reassemble all parts and panels."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0633",
      "reading_order": 711,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 247.81999999999994,
        "r": 546.4600000000003,
        "b": 230.21210084033612
      },
      "content": "Plug in dishwasher or reconnect power and run Service Mode Test to verify repair."
    }
  ]
}